{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Telemetry Before Autonomy.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Telemetry Before Autonomy.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"telemetry before autonomy telemetry before autonomy","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Telemetry Before Autonomy.md","fileName":"Telemetry Before Autonomy.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Telemetry Before Autonomy","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Agent Observability and Evaluation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Agent Observability and Evaluation","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Telemetry Before Autonomy.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Telemetry Before Autonomy.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"telemetry before autonomy telemetry before autonomy","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Telemetry Before Autonomy.md","fileName":"Telemetry Before Autonomy.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Telemetry Before Autonomy","heading":"Telemetry Before Autonomy","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Telemetry before autonomy means an agent must be observable while it still has limited authority. Teams first collect traces, errors, tool results, evaluation outcomes, overrides, latency, and cost, then use that history to decide whether a broader action scope is justified.\n\nGranting authority before measurement makes unsafe behavior difficult to detect and reverses the learning order. Acceptance thresholds should be defined for each use case, failed traces reviewed regularly, and evaluations rerun after any model, prompt, or tool change before autonomy increases.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Agent Observability and Evaluation","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Telemetry Before Autonomy.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Telemetry Before Autonomy.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"telemetry before autonomy telemetry before autonomy","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Telemetry Before Autonomy.md","fileName":"Telemetry Before Autonomy.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Telemetry Before Autonomy","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Agent Observability and Evaluation","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}